# Installation Procedure

In Terminal
1. git clone https://github.com/Chris-Nathaniel/KaizenML-Grup2.git
2. cd .\KaizenML-Grup2\
3. python -m venv .venv
4. .venv/Scriptts/activate
5. pip install -r requirements.txt
6. python train.py
7. get API Key From Kaggle and paste it to download the dataset
8. get API key from ray using "ray get-auth-token"


